<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">YKB ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">YAKUBU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ykb</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAKUBU</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho ata nza anyi na Yakubu reh, a na ni kyangwri Nnoh mboh nza ma a treh atsifi ma inziyo reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh Anyi na amya Yakubu, mya meh bu ahwra Nnoh tasa ata Ada Yeso Kristi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Mya meh ŋa na, na alohsoh agrumavoh a hwa afri nza ma a sangrana a treh akpokpo atsifi mboh ma inziyo agba areh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Mya meh tsifa na amohnoh.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lla Tasa Tsara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, ameh ata ma a leh a de tsara ma atsetse a ba nnoh reh, johjoh nnoh. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Nnoh a kira ta a nza la ha ni gya noh agohsoh amohnoh na a ŋoh. Gya agohsoh amohnoh ni Nnoh a nati a lisa a wuwana tsifa iya amboh areh. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Shi wuwana nimeh wa iya ti te noh ndohmoh a ŋoh, la ti bu noh amboh ata ma a su, ni nati chi nnoh andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Nza akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh a bu na lomo kpeh, ta a kwere Nnoh ata ngǝnga, a nati a ha ŋoh kpeh, a nati a nga ŋoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh ma. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Nza ni nati luhu andromboh na Nnoh neh, luhu na agohsoh anyimbehreh ti kama kpa aniye kpeh. Akyo ata nza a gu la Nnoh a nati a shingi ŋoh kpeh, a tswanza amwo ata nza a bu ma fini agba. Ata inyo nza ka afo a na mgba anyi wa za afo a na mgba anyi. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Kyangwri ata wohroh ta a kama a gu la ŋoh a nati a hunji andromboh anyi na Ada kpeh; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Kyangwri reh a bu na agohsoh afri, ka a de aniye ma akpo anyimbehreh kpeh nimeh ndohmoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />amboh tufa amboh ata nza ma a bu na iya reh mata johjoh la Nnoh a gu mboh a gya a ka ma inza. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Tasa amboh tufa amboh ata nza ma a bu na asabara neh mata a johjoh za la Nnoh a tsana mboh la ma bu andromboh kpeh. amboh asabara mboh za mata a kohnoh la ma a nati a kwo tswanza akru agbeh nza ka a kwo reh. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Nnoh nza ka a gu ikpi a kate ta a yaha gaga reh, ka a de asho mboh a hwara. Akru amoh mboh ka a hwa ma inzi maka za a zohhoh za kpeh. Ma aki wohroh za amboh asabara mboh ma a nati a kwo nza ma a bu nimeh ndohmoh amoh, mata ta asabara amoh mboh.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a shi a lisa yehlehleh nimeh tsara mboh reh, tsifa la nza ma a shi mata a rya tsara mboh reh, ma a nati a hunji firoh fene ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh a nati a nga amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Nza tsara reh ka a hunji akyo,&lt;&lt; Ta a kama a bleh la a bu Nnoh a a tsara ŋoh kpeh&gt;&gt; Maka a sohroh a tsara Nnoh na agugu kpeh, ŋoh ni ikpi a ŋoh ka a sohroh a tsara akyo na agugu kpeh; <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />A bu kohnoh nimeh agohsoh kyangwri nza ka a de ŋoh a te agugu reh. Nza akyo a kira ta a lisa andromboh abibi, neh kohnoh a ŋoh ka a de ŋoh a fi ma aki abibi reh. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Nza kohnoh andromboh abibi reh kǝ sa vru, a nati a de kpakpana; nza kpakpana reh kǝ te agba a nati a de kwo a ba .<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Atsi mya mboh, akyo ta a kama a landa nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Awumu alindeh ka anyi na Nnoh, ŋoh ka a lisa andromboh ata nza a nati a shingi kyangwri mboh. Ŋoh a bu Nnoh ata inza. A lisa awumu mboh ma avereh inza reh nambri ta a de zanana a ba. Awumu mboh reh maka a de zana a ba ma atsetse ni tutu. Maka a sehnehna, Nnoh neh ka a sehnehna kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />A seh reh meh ti bu mara a ŋoh mboh. A te ndohmoh reh na tsifa a ŋoh ata a zizi, la mbohroh reh meh tswanza trenyi nimeh awumu ata Nnoh nza a lisa mboh reh.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kya Ashotoh Ti Lisa Andromboh Ata Nnoh Nza A kira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />mohnoh ambohroh amboh tufa mboh mya nza ni kira na amohnoh reh. Meh kira meh ti bleh noh la kya nnoh ashotoh ti sehreh noh tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh, kama te gbugbo atsi bleh tsifa kohnoh anzoh kpeh, ha ti te gofo na gbugbo kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Kyangwri gofo ka a wina lisa andromboh alindeh ata Nnoh nza a kira kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nza bu dehreh, ta nnoh lisa awumu abibi nza ma a goh nnoh reh, Nnoh kǝ gya tsifa a ŋoh na amohnoh, la ta sa noh a hwana. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Kama bu noh amboh sere tsifa Nnoh ma tsene kpeh, tasa ti kama landa nnoh ikpi amohnoh mboh kpeh, Lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza ma a bleh reh. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Nza akyo ata nza ka a sehreh tsifa ma ta a sohroh a gya tsifa reh ma agohsoh kpeh a tswanza kyangwri ata nza a ka a nza yafa a ŋoh ma amadubi, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Nza kyangwri ka nza yafa a ŋoh ma ta a na ŋoh reh, a nati a te kohhroh na gbugbo ika ata yafa nza a bu reh. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Kyangwri ata neh nza a tufa aki Nnoh reh yehlehleh ata nza a de tuma ikpi a ba, a nati a leh a rya tohmoh a nina, a nati a te kohhroh kpeh na andromboh ata nza a sehreh reh, lisa dehreh ma a nati a te ŋoh atoh na andromboh ata nza a lisa reh. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ha akyo a kohnoh a ŋoh la ŋoh a bu amboh tufa, ŋoh a sohroh a de ameh a ŋoh kpeh, ka a huru ikpi a ŋoh, lomo tufa kyangwri reh ata reh a bu abibi ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Tufa ata Nnoh Ada nza a tsana reh a bu ata zanana tasa ata a zizi reh a bu ata areh: la mata a sumu fya amboh ata tsifa amoh mboh ma a kwo, tasa mara maku mboh atsi wa iya amoh mboh, tasa za mata a shwa mboh niye nimeh agugu tuma ata inziyo agba areh.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi Kira Ikpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />ambohroh mboh, amboh tufa Ada agba Yeso kristi mboh kama tsana noh kira ikpi kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Maka a bleh la, akyo ata nza a bu na Asabara ka aniye a ba nimeh atsi dohsohna amohnoh, a were akuri alilehndeh ha a shi na akpreh ata kpakpa hungroh ma ameh ivoh a ŋoh, kyangwri iya anyi za ka aniye a ba na kuri ata nza kǝ hwahwashina . <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Nza ni lisa noh alindeh ma kyangwri asabara reh ti bleh noh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma ma ikpi kpra alindeh ata areh,&gt;&gt; Neh ti bleh noh ma kyangwri iya reh la, &lt;&lt; Shi na a hwa na na ma ari,&gt;&gt; Ha ti bleh noh la &lt;&lt; Tuma ma inzi,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />nza ni lisa noh dehreh ni bu noh na kohnoh abibi. mohnoh ni gu nnoh la akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh a keh akyo anyi. Kama lisa nnoh dehreh kpeh.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />ambohroh mboh sere meh noh, Nnoh reh a seh ta a te atoh ma amboh ata ma bu iya ma reh ma inziyo areh. A shingi mboh mata a kira na ŋoh. Ma bu na asabara zizi. Nnoh a nati a nga mboh atsifi ma akpo afiya a ŋoh ata inziyo areh. A bleh a gya dehreh na amboh ata ma a kira na ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />mohnoh neh ni kǝ sohroh lisa nnoh alindeh ma amboh iya mboh kpeh. A bu amboh asabara mboh reh ŋa nza ma a leh a nga noh iya reh kpeh? A bu mboh nza maka a wa nnoh a na ma atsi hwra akpi la mata a ka nnoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />A bu amboh asabara mboh reh nza ma a leh atsifa agugu ma ikpi isa alindeh ata Yeso Kristi reh. Tasa mohnoh za ma a fi noh la amboh tufa Kristi mboh la ni bu noh na a ŋoh.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Tsifa Nnoh nza a bu ma amgbasho reh neh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh&gt;&gt; Nza ni lisa dehreh, ni lisa alindeh. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Nza neh ni kira mgbiri kyangwri mboh ti leke mgbiri mboh, areh a bu abibi, amgbasho hwra akpi reh a tsana la ni lisa noh abibi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Nza akyo ata nza a tufa amgbasho akpi reh nambri ta a kpakpa na na anyi nimeh, ŋoh kǝ hwa, a bu tswanza a sohroh a tufa amgbasho akpi reh kpeh nambri. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Nnoh ata nza a bleh la, &lt;&lt; Kama leh ahohndoh kpeh&gt;&gt;A bleh za la &lt;&lt; Kama mla akyo kwo kpeh.&gt;&gt; Nza ni leh ahohndoh kpeh neh, ti mla akyo kwo, noh ni bu kyangwri kpakpana. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Tsifa ti kǝ kohnoh nnoh la Nnoh a nati a hwra noh akpi ibi anyi nimeh tsifa tasa ndohmoh na akpi ata nza a sa reh anvara reh. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nnoh a nati a sohroh a soh ivoh yira na akyo ata nza a ka a sohroh a soh ivoh yira na mgbiri kyangwri mboh kpeh, kwini a ka a firu hwra akpi.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nga Agohsoh Tasa Te Ndohmoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa Yeso mboh, nza kyangwri a bu na nga agohsoh ta a bu na ndohmoh kpeh Nnoh, neh nnoh nati tsana noh nimeh ndohmoh, nza a bu dehreh kpeh tufa amohnoh reh a nati a sohroh a shingi nnoh kpeh, a nati a sohroh a sa noh anvara kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Maka a bleh la, atohngoh amohnoh anyi a bu na awumu rya kpeh ha kuri. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Nza akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt; Na ni niye nnoh alindeh, Nnoh ta a nga noh awumu rya tasa awumu were hama itoh,&gt;&gt; neh a sohroh a nga andromboh kpeh ata itoh amoh kpeh wohroh reh a nati a sohroh a shingi mboh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Aki tufa Nnoh reh za a bu dehreh, nza nga agohsoh ambohroh a sohroh a nga reh iko lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh, neh a sohroh a bu andromboh alindeh kpeh a zaka a bu kohmoh ma.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Neh akyo anyi a nati a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni bu na nga agohsoh, mya neh meh lisa ndohmoh alindeh ata nza a shingi kyangwri mboh &gt;&gt; tsana meh nga agohsoh anzoh ata nza a bu na ndohmoh kpeh reh, mya meh nati tsana nga agohsoh amya atsi te ndohmoh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 2:18">Tsana meh nga agohsoh anzoh ata nza a bu tse na te ndohmoh reh, mya meh nati tsana noh nga agohsoh amya nimeh te ndohmoh. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Nnoh ni kira la Nnoh a bu anyimbehreh. A zohhoh dehreh! inyo mboh za ma wina dehreh tasa maka nyiri ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Nnoh ni duduna, nnoh ni kira la mya te tsana noh la nga agohsoh ata nza a sohroh a bu na te ndohmoh kpeh a bu were ma? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Kohnoh Ada ambohroh Ibrahim nza a gu amehreh a ŋoh Ishaku a fa a yaha ma ikpi kpakpa yaha awumu, la ta bu nga ata nana agohsoh ma tohmoh Nnoh, Nnoh ka a kira na a ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />A bu tsifa nga agohsoh tasa ndohmoh Ibrahim reh ŋa a shingi ŋoh ka a lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira, nza a lisa dehreh reh a tsana la ŋoh a nga agohsoh a ŋoh ma Nnoh nambri. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Tsifa Nnoh ka a su nza a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ibrahim a nga agohsoh ma Nnoh maka a fi nga agohsoh reh la tufa yehlehleh&gt;&gt;Tasa Nnoh ka a fi Ibrahim la iza a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />mohnoh nza noh, kyangwri ka a hunji tuma ata kpakpana a yama kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh tsifa ndohmoh alindeh a ŋoh reh, a bu tsifa gya agohsoh yehlehleh a ŋoh tsene kpeh.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />A bu dehreh na angra Rahab na ameh ata ta ka a huho amboh hende were iyo nza atsifi mboh reh, a shingi mboh ma a ka anvara ma aki anyi tse? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Nza a bu dehreh, nza itoh kyangwri a bu na huru kpeh, a tswanza kohmoh reh, tasa za nga agohsoh akyo ata nza a te ndohmoh kpeh a tswanza kohmoh reh za.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lisa Nza feh si Bleh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />ambohroh mboh, nimeh amohnoh gaga ti bu noh amboh tsana kpeh, mbohroh amboh ata nza meh leh tsana tsifa Nnoh reh, ma a nati a jiji ahwra reh akpi ata rinana ŋoh a keh mgbiri kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Mbohroh za meh kǝ leh kpakpana gaga na ambohroh mboh. Nza akyo ata ka kpakpana kpeh nimeh tsifa a ŋoh, ŋoh a bu kyangwri alindeh, a nati a wina de ibǝba itoh a ŋoh mboh reh nambri za.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Mbohroh meh kǝ lafa aniye ma nyama tswanza ameh ikpoh la ta a sehreh lomo ambohroh a wina. Ma aki wohroh reh meh kǝ wina kama nyama reh na atsi ata mbohroh meh kira. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />mohnoh ti nza noh gbogblondo amwo mboh nza maka a hehndeh ma ikpi amwo reh, ma bu agbugba awumu mboh, tasa za a bu inyo ata nza a wuwana ka a yi mboh, dehreh za, a bu kyangwri kama gbogblondo amwo reh ka a kama na ameh ikpoh a na akpokpo atsifi mboh na kira ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Arimi a bu andromboh akehreh nimeh itoh kyangwri, ŋoh neh ka a bleh agbugba tsifa mboh ata rya itoh. Tasa ti gyuru kohnoh nnoh tsifa ata areh nza noh za la, ameh ri shira akehreh nza ka a lofo mbla a treh nambri. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Arimi kyangwri a tswanza shira nimeh iba itoh ambohroh mboh, arimi a bu chuhu agugu mboh reh nambri ata nza ka a de itoh nambri a nasa, ata nza ka a de itoh nambri a te abibi, ata ka ata agohsoh kyangwri ta a ka, a bu afya shira nza a leh ata ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Kyangwri ka a wina de wo aye mboh reh ma asaa, akuku mboh, tasa amboh gbo ma inzi na agohsoh mboh, tasa amboh ata ma a bu nimeh amwo mboh ta a tsana mboh aki, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />akyo neh a nati a wina tsana aki ma arimi a ŋoh kpeh. Arimi a bu agugu andromboh ata ka a sohroh a tuma afo shidi kpeh, a bu na toso ata nza a nati a wina mla akyo a fi kohmoh.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Mbohroh meh kǝ krumusu Nnoh tasa Ada mbohroh na arimi tasa za meh ti gyuru kya kyangwri mboh za na wohroh, amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa mboh a tswanza ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Ha aniye anyimbehreh wohroh mbohroh meh kǝ riri tasa meh ti gyuru kya na wohroh za, ambohroh mboh a zohhoh ta bu dehreh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ha amwo ata nza ka a kate anyi ma inzi tasa ata nza a bu na mma, ma a nati a wina nyi ma akpo anyimbehreh? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />ambohroh mboh, agbeh mgbungba a nati wina mara Akpehngeh? ha agbeh kpa ta mara agbeh mgbungba? Ma aki wohroh za itsiyo amwo ata nza a bu na mma, a nati a wina a de amwo ata nza a bu na mma kpeh a kate kpeh.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomo Ata Nza Anyi Inza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />A bu anyi a bu na lomo tasa nza wina nimeh amohnoh? Ta akyo wohroh ta a tsana lomo a ŋoh reh anyi na agohsoh alindeh tasa ndohmoh alindeh ata ŋoh ka a lisa na kuku ikpi reh, ata ka a ba ŋoh anyi nimeh lomo. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Nza neh nimeh agohsoh amohnoh mboh ni bu noh na vene tasa kira kpi, kama gu nnoh kpi ka nnoh, ha ti leke nnoh tsifa ata a zizi reh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Lomo&gt;&gt; ikata areh a bu wohroh nza a tamba anyi ma inza a ba reh kpeh, neh a bu ata inziyo mi. A bu ata huru kpeh, a bu ata agugu a ŋoh mi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Atsi ata vene tasa kira ikpi nza a yama, ma a huru ni nati hunji noh agǝshi tasa ndohmoh agugu ma atsetse.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Lomo ata neh nza a jiji anyi inza reh a bu fyafya, tasa za ka a de tuma alindeh a ba, tasa za a bu na ve tasa kuku ikpi, tasa za a bu na kwini tasa za a bu na ndohmoh alindeh. A bu ata ka a tsana kira ikpi ha ata agugu kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />amboh ata maka a de tuma alindeh a ba ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh, maka a shingi mboh mata a tuma alindeh. Ma aki wohroh kyangwri mboh ma a nati a lisa awumu alilehndeh ata nza a zohhoh.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nga Nnoh Ikpi Amohnoh Ma Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ka a bu mboh ka a de mlana tasa gohroh a ba nimeh amohnoh? Ha ma anyi na abibi kohnoh awumu nana mboh nza a bu nimeh amohnoh nza ma a leh a mlana reh kpeh? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ni kǝ fa nnoh andromboh na wuwana ni kǝ hunji noh kpeh. Ni kǝ gyuru mla nnoh mgbiri kyangwri mboh za, mohnoh neh ni kǝ hunji noh andromboh ata ni fa nnoh reh kpeh. Ni kǝ gohroh nnoh ti mlana nnoh za, ni kǝ hunji noh kpeh, tsifa ni kwere nnoh Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />mohnoh ni kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh ni kǝ hunji noh kpeh, tsifa la ni kwere nnoh na agohsoh abibi ata ndohmoh abibi ata nza nana itoh amohnoh ma.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />mohnoh ni gbo ta nnoh Nnoh tswanza afiya ata nza a leh ahohndoh na mgbiri tsifa mboh reh. Ni seh ti bu noh iziza na kyangwri amboh ata ma a kira na Nnoh kpeh. mohnoh za na ikpi amohnoh ni fi noh Nnoh ma tohmoh. Ti wina noh wohroh. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Ha ni kohnoh nza noh la amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh a bu wusu ma la,&lt;&lt; Nnoh reh a bu na vene ata kira ma ikpi huru ata nza a bu na ambohroh reh zizi? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Nnoh neh nga reh andromboh alindeh a mishi. Tsifa wohroh amgbasho reh a tsana la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">&lt;&lt; Nnoh ka a leke ata ka a gu ikpi a ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">ka a lisa andromboh alindeh ma akyo ata nza akuku ikpi a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nza a bu dehreh nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh na agba ma ma Nnoh. kama nga noh agugu aki kpeh, ŋoh a nati a gbo anyi na amohnoh. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />mohnoh kpusu ba nnoh ni Nnoh, ŋoh za a nati a kpusu a ba ma inda amohnoh. Wra nnoh ivoh amohnoh mboh, mohnoh amboh kpakpa mboh, tasa za ti hwara nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh na agohsoh afri. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ni bu noh na hungwa agohsoh, ni kpanga nnoh, ni te nnoh amwo iyo. Ta nnoh wehneh amohnoh ta a gyuruna a te kpanga, zanana agohsoh amohnoh ta a gyuruna a te hungwa agohsoh. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Gu ikpi amohnoh tamba ma tohmoh Ada mbohroh, ŋoh za a nati a gu nnoh a ka.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />ambohroh mboh, kama bu noh amboh tsifa kya nnoh itoh amohnoh mboh kpeh. Tsifa la akyo ata nza a kya atohngoh kyangwri tufa, a buti kya akpi reh. Nza ni hwra akpi ma atohngoh kyangwri tufa, ni buti hwra akpi ma akpi reh za, nza ni lisa dehreh, ni sohroh nga nnoh agba ma akpi reh kpeh. Nza ni lisa dehreh, ni buti nga ikpi anzoh agba ti kohnoh andromboh ata akpi reh a bleh. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />A bu Nnoh ma tsehneh tsana, a bu ŋoh za ka ahwra akpi. A bu ŋoh ma tsehneh ka a de nvara a ba, a bu ŋoh za a bu na wuwana ta a lofo reh nambri. Nza ka a bu dehreh, nnoh ni kǝ bu anyi ti nga kpakpana ma atohngoh anzoh?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Va Ivoh Ma Agohsoh Na Ikya kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />nehnehreh sehreh noh, nnoh ata nza ni bleh la, &lt;&lt; Andrehmeh ha ikya meh nati na ambohroh akpo afiya anyi, meh ti na ni tuma te ahushi anyimbehreh leh sa awumu meh ti rifa hunji hungroh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />mohnoh neh ni sohroh wina noh andromboh ata nza a nati a bu dehreh ikya kpeh. Fene amohnoh reh a bu ikata ma? a zaka a tswanza avereh nza ka a kate shidi ta a gyuru a sangrana reh. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />A zohhoh ti bleh noh la, &lt;&lt; Nza Nnoh a kira, ha nza mbohroh meh bu nimeh amboh fene, meh nati lisa ata areh tasa ata areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Tswanza nza bu nehnehreh, ni leh va nnoh ivoh ma agohsoh ti leh johjoh nnoh. Biroh va ivoh ma agohsoh ika ata areh a bu andromboh abibi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, akyo ata nza a wina andromboh alindeh ta a lisa kpeh reh, a kpakpana.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ma Kpi Ashotoh Ma amboh Asabara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Kya nnoh ashotoh nehnehreh mohnoh amboh asabara mboh, kpanga nnoh ti te nnoh kpiriga tsifa iya nza a nati ba ma ikpi amohnoh reh. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Asabara amohnoh kǝ hwina, shinga mboh ma a rya akuri amohnoh nambri. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri tasa kpakpa hungroh ata atasaa ma a hwa hohngoh. Hwa hohngoh reh a bu kpra ma ikpi amohnoh, a nati a rya iwo itoh amohnoh a treh twanza shira. mohnoh ti fira nnoh asabara ma ikpi amohnoh ibi ata trina reh. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Nza hungroh nara amboh te ndohmoh ayeye amohnoh mboh, ata nza ni leke ti fanga mboh nnoh la tsifa agohsoh abibi amohnoh mboh, a leh a kpanga na Nnoh. Dehreh za kpanga amboh fasa awumu ma aye amohnoh mboh reh kǝ ka ba ma ashotoh amya Nnoh Ada ata meh bu agba. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ni tuma leh wa nnoh nana ma inziyo areh, ni wa ti rya nnoh andromboh ni kira nnoh. nimeh nza ni nana, nehnehreh ni bu noh tswanza iwo aye agba ata kǝ tswa mata a fa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ni hwra noh akpi ma akyo ata nza a bu na kpakpana kpeh, tasa za ni gyuru mla mboh nnoh kwo za, mboh neh ma a sohroh a fi noh ma tomo kpeh.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soh Ivoh Yira Nimeh Wa Iya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nza a bu dehreh ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, tuma noh na soh ivoh ma yira ti bana nnoh ibi ata Ada nza a nati a ba reh. Nza nnoh biroh soh ivoh ma yira ata kyangwri hafa a ka a bana awumu aye ta abina reh. Nimeh soh ivoh ma yira ka a bana awi ata jiji tasa ata trina. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />mohnoh za ti bu noh amboh soh ivoh yira, ti shi wuwana nnoh, la ibi ba Ada reh kǝ ba hwiri. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, kama bleh noh tsifa abibi ma itoh amohnoh kpeh, nza ni lisa noh dehreh, Nnoh a nati a hwra noh akpi. Kyangwri hwra akpi reh kǝ shi ma anida.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, lisa nza noh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh nza ma atsifa na sa Ada reh. Tufa nnoh aki amoh ata nza ma tuma na soh ivoh ma yira nimeh wa iya reh. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Nza amboh ata nza ma a shi a wuwana nimeh wa iya reh, meh kǝ bleh la mboh reh ma a bu amboh atoh mboh. Ni wina noh biroh shi wuwana ata Ayuba ta ka a lisa reh, ni wina noh biroh atoh ata Nnoh nza nga ŋoh ma trina reh, Nnoh ka a soh ivoh ma yira tasa za ka a nza kwini. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />nza ka a bu dehreh za ambohroh mboh, kama fa nnoh aku mbimbi kpeh, ha na inza, ha na inzi, ha na andromboh anyi. Kira amohnoh ta a bu la, &lt;&lt;Ha&gt;&gt; tasa leke amohnoh ta a bu la,&lt;&lt; Wa&gt;&gt; were ma, ta ka bu dehreh ma la Nnoh ta a kama a hwra noh akpi kpeh.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Nnoh Ata amboh Nga Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ha akyo anyi a yama nimeh amohnoh ata nza a leh a wa iya? Ta a kwere Nnoh. Ha akyo anyi a yama nimeh amohnoh nza a leh a johjoh? Ta a kpa amumu ta a krumusu Nnoh. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ha akyo anyi a yama nimeh amohnoh nza a wuwana kpeh? Ta a fi agbugba amboh ida Nnoh mboh mata a kwere Nnoh mata awo ŋoh amehneh nimeh sa Ada Nnoh. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Kwere Nnoh ata kyangwri nga agohsoh nza a kwere reh, a nati a de kyangwri bishi a wuwana; Ada Nnoh a nati nga ŋoh wuwana. Nza a kpakpana, ma a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana ŋoh. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nza a bu dehreh bleh noh kpakpana amohnoh ma itoh amohnoh ti kwere nnoh Nnoh ma itoh amohnoh la mata nga noh wuwana. kwere Nnoh kyangwri ata nza bu yehlehleh ka a wuwana tasa za ka a te ndohmoh. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iliya a bu kyangwri tswanza mbohroh. Tana a kwere Nnoh a wuwana la awi ta a kama anyi inza a ba kpeh, awi ka a sohroh a ba kpeh a te ahushi atatoh tasa nara atehrehkifi. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Tasa za ka a gyuru a kwere Nnoh za, inza reh ka a vuru na nga reh awi, inzi za ta nga reh awumu rya. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, nza akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh ata aki ata nza bu zizi reh, akyo anyi neh ta a fi ŋoh a ba ma aki, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />kohnoh tsifa ata areh nza, la akyo ata nza a de kyangwri kpakpana a ba ma aki ta nga ŋoh nvara anyi ma kwo, ata areh a nati bu aki te kohhroh na kpakpana amboh kpakpana mboh vara.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>